WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.934
What's your purpose? 
What's your cause?

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.293
What's your belief?

00:00:03.293 --> 00:00:05.232
Every single person,
every single organization

00:00:05.232 --> 00:00:07.471
on the&nbsp;planet
knows what they do,

00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:08.444
100 percent.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.530
Some know
how they do it,

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.456
but very, very few&nbsp;people 
or organizations

00:00:14.456 --> 00:00:16.439
know why they do 
what they do.

00:00:16.439 --> 00:00:17.674
Well as a result, 
the way we think,

00:00:17.674 --> 00:00:19.370
the way we act,
the way we communicate

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.137
is from the outside in,
it's obvious.

00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:24.000
We go from the clearest thing 
to&nbsp;the fuzziest thing.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.779
But the inspired leaders

00:00:25.779 --> 00:00:28.072
and the inspired 
organizations --

00:00:28.072 --> 00:00:29.497
regardless of their&nbsp;size,

00:00:29.497 --> 00:00:31.155
regardless of their industry --

00:00:31.155 --> 00:00:33.123
all think, act and 
communicate

00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:35.016
from the inside&nbsp;out.

00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:37.127
And if you talk about 
what you believe,

00:00:37.127 --> 00:00:38.315
you will attract those

00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:39.757
who believe what 
you&nbsp;believe.

00:00:39.757 --> 00:00:42.000
And it's those who 
start with "why"

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.668
that have the ability

00:00:44.668 --> 00:00:46.874
to inspire those&nbsp;
around them

00:00:46.874 --> 00:00:49.582
or find others who 
inspire them.

